    "license_note": "No explicit license grant was found in the cdecl source directory or its parent Prolangs-C directory at the pinned commit. This package is a clean-room implementation of a bounded declarator grammar and precedence behavior; it does not copy upstream code, comments, or generated parser text, and does not claim an upstream license."
